# UI-GHOST-2: ghost hides overlappable scenery/tile objects (flag 0x20) under its footprint,
# immediately restores them on move/cancel/unaffordable-phase-1, keeps placed tiles cleared,
# draws only the yellow (0xffff00) empty rectangle on refusal without hiding trees, and keeps the
# Occupied blocking-footprint outline ADAPTATION default OFF.
# Run with ANNO_DEV_GOODS_TONS=6: pioneer house 501 (wood 3) is Valid; market 1301 (wood 7) is Unaffordable.
resize 1024 768
look 1188 516
wait frames 5
expect fact tool.ghost == hidden
expect fact tool.ghost.suppressed == 0
screenshot forest_baseline

key b
wait frames 5
click_px 833 330
wait frames 5
expect title build 501

# 1) Valid hover over forest tile (1188, 516) suppresses underlying flag-0x20 object(s).
hover-land 1188 516
wait fact tool.ghost == valid
wait frames 3
expect fact tool.ghost.suppressed > 0
expect fact tool.ghost.pixels > 0
expect fact tool.ghost.occupied_pixels == 0
screenshot forest_valid

# 2) Moving away immediately restores (1188, 516).
hover-land 1176 516
wait frames 3
screenshot forest_moved_away

# 3) Hover back (suppresses again), then right-click cancel (restores immediately).
hover-land 1188 516
wait fact tool.ghost == valid
wait frames 3
expect fact tool.ghost.suppressed > 0
rclick_px 400 384
wait fact tool.ghost == hidden
wait frames 3
expect fact tool.ghost.suppressed == 0
expect fact tool.ghost.pixels == 0
screenshot forest_cancelled

# 4) Re-arm pioneer house 501 -> refused over inlet (1148, 536) draws yellow box only, suppresses 0.
click_px 833 330
wait frames 5
look 1148 536
wait frames 3
hover-land 1148 536
wait fact tool.ghost == refused
wait frames 3
expect fact tool.ghost.suppressed == 0
expect fact tool.ghost.pixels > 0
expect fact tool.ghost.occupied_pixels == 0
screenshot ghost_refused

# 5) Occupied refusal over 4x4 Kontor (1284, 540): ADAPTATION is default OFF -> 0 red outline pixels.
look 1284 540
wait frames 3
hover-land 1283 540
wait fact tool.ghost.verdict == Occupied
expect fact tool.ghost == refused
wait frames 3
expect fact tool.ghost.suppressed == 0
expect fact tool.ghost.pixels > 0
expect fact tool.ghost.occupied_pixels == 0
screenshot occupied_default_off

# 6) Unaffordable blink phase 0 vs phase 1 over forest (1188, 516) using market 1301 (wood 7 > 6).
rclick_px 400 384
wait frames 3
click_px 937 330
wait frames 5
expect title build 1301
look 1188 516
wait frames 3
hover-land 1188 516
wait fact tool.ghost == unaffordable
wait fact tool.ghost.phase == 1
wait fact tool.ghost.phase == 0
wait frames 2
expect fact tool.ghost.suppressed > 0
expect fact tool.ghost.pixels > 0
screenshot forest_unaff_phase0

wait fact tool.ghost.phase == 1
wait frames 2
expect fact tool.ghost.suppressed == 0
expect fact tool.ghost.pixels > 0
screenshot forest_unaff_phase1

# 7) Placing pioneer house 501 over (1188, 516) clears its footprint permanently while cancelling restores.
rclick_px 400 384
wait frames 3
click_px 833 330
wait frames 5
click 1188 516
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
expect fact picture.cleared_tiles > 0
rclick_px 400 384
wait fact tool.ghost == hidden
wait frames 3
screenshot forest_placed
quit
